<section class="please-loop article-wide not-prose" aria-labelledby="please-loop-heading">
  <header>
    <p>Interpretive model</p>
    <h2 id="please-loop-heading">The Please Force operating loop</h2>
  </header>
  <ol>
    <li><span>1</span><div><strong>Receive</strong><p>A frightened, hungry, lost, or overwhelmed person reaches the volunteer area.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>2</span><div><strong>Stabilize</strong><p>Food, calm company, useful information, humor, or a safer setting reduces immediate distress.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>3</span><div><strong>Return agency</strong><p>The person is treated as a participant who can understand the situation and make a next choice.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>4</span><div><strong>Recruit care</strong><p>Some people who recover help the next arrivals, increasing capacity inside the crowd.</p></div></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="please-loop__note">This loop is HobFarm's reading of the film dialogue and the Hog Farm record. It is not a clinical protocol or a term the group used.</p>
</section>

